Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:54:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] SA4: tools/winprof.py (profile a speed-tour window's own
 ticks) and two speed2 groups (talk, sa4)

tools/winprof.py cuts a speed2 script at a window, profiles the window's ticks instead of its
last wait (harness --worklog: the slow frames' extra functions) and prints each function's share
and ms per drawn frame; 'misses' does it for every window of GBA speed2 logs whose verdict is not
ok. Its unit test runs in make -C core test (speed-tools-check). speed2_talk.txt: the Talk screen
(GBA and Dreamcast; the PS1 has no Talk screen yet). speed2_sa4.txt: the level select's page turn
and the creator's body types and a held build slider (CR-BODY). No game code changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
