+# speed2_sa4.txt - speed tour 2 (SA2), a group speed audit 4 added (docs/design/SPEED_AUDIT4.md): screens that
+# landed after speed audit 3. The level select's page turn (LV0 pages; one page until a level package builds a
+# page's levels) and the creator's body types and a build slider held (CR-BODY). The Talk screen is
+# speed2_talk.txt. Window rules: speed2_fair.txt.
+wait 40
+expect-log doomo: init
+sync on 61
+
+# ---- the level select: a page turn (LV0) -------------------------------------------------
+seed 1
+scene TITLE
+wait 2
+push LEVEL_SELECT 0
+wait 40
+press DOWN
+wait 2
+fps start
+wait 30
+fps levels: level select page turn
+shot sa4_level_page
+fps start
+wait 90
+fps levels: level select other page
+press UP
+wait 2
+fps start
+wait 30
+fps levels: level select page back
+
+# ---- the creator: body types and a build slider held (CR-BODY) ---------------------------
+seed 1
+scene TITLE
+wait 2
+push CREATOR -1
+wait 200
+press DOWN
+press DOWN
+wait 6
+fps start
+press RIGHT
+wait 30
+fps creator: body type step
+shot sa4_body_type
+fps start
+press RIGHT
+wait 4
+press RIGHT
+wait 4
+press RIGHT
+wait 4
+press RIGHT
+wait 4
+press RIGHT
+wait 14
+fps creator: body type steps
+press DOWN
+wait 6
+fps start
+down LEFT
+wait 60
+release
+fps creator: height slider held
+shot sa4_height_held
+fps start
+press A
+wait 30
+fps creator: slider reset
