+# list, the answer box (DIALOG over the Talk screen) and the menu after a reply. Talk runs on the GBA and the
+# Dreamcast (TD1); the PS1 has no Talk screen yet (TKP), so ps1/harness/speed2.sh is not given this group.
+# Window rules: speed2_fair.txt. talk.txt's pinned seed 18 (the resident's lines follow the town seed).
+wait 40
+expect-log doomo: init
+sync on 61
+
+# ---- Talk: a conversation (push TALK 1 after the premade island moved in, as talk.txt) ----
