+wait 2
+fps start
+wait 30
+fps talk: menu cursor move
+press DOWN
+wait 4
+press DOWN
+wait 4
+press DOWN
+wait 4
+fps start
+press A
+wait 30
+fps talk: chat list open
+shot sa4_talk_chat
